  "descriptionMarkdown": "early game hub using wrecked spacecraft as materials mall + science \n\ndesigned to get most of the red / green science research done for you along with a mini mall to build early defense, blue gray science, main belt materials etc.  (perhaps while you are using the car to toss grenades into every biter nest that might encroach your future factory) \n\neasy to build the blueprint materials by hand or with automation help.   this blueprint assumes youve already accrued several of the earliest red sciences and have also built enough smelting to produce 15/sec of both iron and copper plates.  \n\n\nUser Manual:\n~~~~~~~~~~~\nmake sure the iron plate / copper plate input line is full at all times.  \n\ntwo additional inputs by hand are wood for power poles and steel for engines\n\nthere is more iron and copper coming in than is being consumed at full capacity, so the system will eventually become completely stable\n\nWARNING\nwatch closely the wreck inventory (five slots) from startup until it stabilizes at (almost)constant full = must include iron plates, copper plates, gears, and green circuits.   sometimes it will clog for example with too many copper plates while the iron is all being consumed.   ",
